ed","size":350,"digest":"sha256:c6d46c957b4a6ff65e93b0c1791b3afd8b638bd0da66cab25f43a6941ae4cd7b","download_count":2010,"created_at":"2026-10-23T11:33:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T11:33:35Z"}],"body":"## 更新重点\n\n- 新增跨轮次会话任务记录，Agent 可持续跟进用户目标并保存完成依据 (#3499)\n- 新增会话任务抽屉，可跳转到关联对话；完善移动端列表、任务详情与会话名称，减少琐碎任务记录 (#3501、#3509、#3510)\n- 远程 Studio 的 Agent 可在桌面端明确授权后使用本机内置浏览器，支持随时停止共享 (#3478)\n- 账号主题快捷切换新增跟随系统模式；统一抽屉的顶部间距、主题背景与直角样式 (#3496、#3475)\n- 群聊空状态展示全部 Agent，并适配不同窗口宽度 (#3471)\n- Ekko 默认推理强度调整为无，统一单聊、群聊和工作流中的 Agent 标签 (#3488)\n- 修复停止后思考指示器不消失，以及工具结果截断时中文或表情损坏、请求失败的问题 (#3473、#3457、#3460)\n- 服务商导入链接支持自动 API 模式；JEV 兼容带版本前缀及完整接口地址，并区分接口缺失与模型错误 (#3494、#3493、#3491)\n- 桌面截图缺少录屏权限时可直接前往系统设置授权，避免阻塞式弹窗 (#3492)\n- 修复 Windows ARM64 原生 Hermes 运行时构建中的依赖与终端兼容问题 (#3429)\n- 停止提供 TerraMaster TOS 专用安装包与自动构建支持 (#3503)\n- 会话任务新增创建与完成 Webhook 事件，支持分别订阅，并按内容开关控制任务标题、摘要和完成依据的发送 (#3512)\n- Studio 与桌面端版本同步更新为 `0.7.39`，前端更新日志覆盖 12 种语言并保留最近三个版本 (#3511)。\n\n## What's Changed\n* Show all agent avatars in responsive group chat empty states by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3471\n* Stop the thinking indicator after abort completion by @widechaos in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3473\n* [codex] keep drawers below the header with themed backgrounds and square corners by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3475\n* fix(chat): preserve surrogate pairs when truncating tool results by @widechaos in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3457\n* fix(agent): cut tool results on character boundaries instead of UTF-16 halves by @fxqq in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3460\n* fix(app-relay): log every auth rejection instead of failing silently by @kosmo888 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3487\n* fix: default Ekko reasoning to none and unify agent labels by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3488\n* fix: pin CI and Docker Node.js to 24.22.1 by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3489\n* feat(browser): allow remote Studio agents to use consented Desktop browser by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3478\n* support auto API mode in provider import links by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3494\n* [codex] accept full JEV provider endpoint URLs by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3493\n* fix(jev): report missing endpoints as address errors (#3490) by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3491\n* [codex] route command approvals through Studio by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3495\n* fix(desktop): offer screenshot permission authorization without a blocking dialog by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3492\n* feat(theme): add follow-system mode to account theme shortcut by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3496\n* feat: track session goals across turns with native and MCP tools by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3499\n* chore: discontinue TerraMaster TOS packaging support by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3503\n* feat: add a session task drawer with chat turn navigation by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3501\n* revert: roll back Codex app-server approval integration (#3495) by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3505\n* fix: stabilize task links and polish mobile task lists by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3509\n* fix: reduce task noise and resolve untitled session names by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3510\n* [codex] fix native Windows ARM64 Hermes runtime builds by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3429\n* chore: prepare Studio 0.7.39 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3511\n* feat: send webhooks when session tasks are created or completed by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3512\n\n## New Contributors\n* @fxqq made their first contribution in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3460\n* @kosmo888 made their first contribution in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3487\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.38...v0.7.39","mentions_count":5}
